[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2636071574","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102440#issuecomment-2636071574","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102440","id":2636071574,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dH0KW","user":{"login":"RandomShaper","id":11797174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk3MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11797174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper","html_url":"https://github.com/RandomShaper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RandomShaper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T08:36:14Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T08:36:14Z","body":"Following you latest comment on the issue, I agree with this approach.\r\n\r\nAside, I'm wondering if we're using two different terms to mean the same across the API and implementation: \"internal\" and \"not exposed\". If that's true, we may want to harominze the terminology.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2636071574/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2758565181","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102440#issuecomment-2758565181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102440","id":2758565181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kbF09","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T15:56:26Z","updated_at":"2025-03-27T15:56:26Z","body":"> Side note, I did search through the code base a bit to find instances of internal classes and make some research, but was surprised to see `GDREGISTER_INTERNAL_CLASS` isn't used once in the code base. So i didn't actually end up finding any.\r\n\r\nThe only usage was removed in #102433 as an alternative way to fix #99534.\r\n\r\nI'm fuzzy on why we have this feature in the first place though. It was added by @Daylily-Zeleen in #70329 but there wasn't much justification for why this is useful (no proposal). @dsnopek seemed to think it was a good addition though and I trust your judgement on that, but it might be worth to refresh our memory on the original context to see if this PR does what's expected, and whether this feature should be available for Godot classes if it was intended only for GDExtensions.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2758565181/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2758616704","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102440#issuecomment-2758616704","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102440","id":2758616704,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kbSaA","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-27T16:13:59Z","updated_at":"2025-07-14T19:45:23Z","body":"> I'm fuzzy on why we have this feature in the first place though. It was added by @Daylily-Zeleen in #70329 but there wasn't much justification for why this is useful (no proposal). @dsnopek seemed to think it was a good addition though and I trust your judgement on that, but it might be worth to refresh our memory on the original context to see if this PR does what's expected, and whether this feature should be available for Godot classes if it was intended only for GDExtensions.\r\n\r\nSo, we've had unexposed classes for a long time, however, they were registered by not explicitly registering them. Basically, if you used `GDCLASS()` but didn't call `GDREGISTER_CLASS()`, then the unexposed class would get registered in `ClassDB` the first time an instance of it was created.\r\n\r\nHowever, this pattern doesn't work as well for GDExtension, where we're registering all classes explicitly. That's why we needed `GDREGISTER_INTERNAL_CLASS()` for GDExtension. And, so then for API parity between modules and GDExtensions, it made sense to also have `GDREGISTER_INTERNAL_CLASS()` in Godot too.\r\n\r\nAnyway, in short, PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/70329 didn't add the concept of unexposed classes (those existed for far longer), it just added a way to explicitly register them.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2758616704/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2760001808","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102440#issuecomment-2760001808","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102440","id":2760001808,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kgkkQ","user":{"login":"Daylily-Zeleen","id":61624558,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjI0NTU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61624558?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen","html_url":"https://github.com/Daylily-Zeleen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daylily-Zeleen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T02:16:52Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T02:16:52Z","body":"It seems involve multiple PRs/issues, I'm not sure if the response here is accurate.\r\n\r\nThe initial Initial intention for \"internal_class\" (register by `GDREGISTER_INTERNAL_CLASS()`) is to register an unexposed class, but still need to be use through `ClassDB`.\r\n\r\nLike add custom `EditorPlugin` or `ResourceFormatSaver` from GDExtension, they need to obtain bindings from `ClassDB` in order to interact with godot, but not need to expose to users. This is different from godot.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2760001808/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2761477346","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102440#issuecomment-2761477346","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102440","id":2761477346,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kmMzi","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T14:08:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T14:08:39Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2761477346/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]